# The deploy workflow runs `npm run build` on push and uploads its own ./dist, so the tracked dist
# is a convenience copy that is never served. Keeping the post's 24 MB of castle footage in it
# would put a second copy of every video in git history for nothing; the source of truth is
# public/blj.
